The comedy is structural, not incidental. You set out to be a Curator—a collector, a scholar, an institution—and the actual transcript is you breaking into someone else's museum, killing the guards, and then deciding the loot isn't worth the carry weight. That's the whole joke in one run: the completist who abandons things because his inventory says so.
